    "title": "Happy Easter! See Florida restaurants, fast food open or closed today",
    "text": "April 5, 2026, 6:01 a.m. ETMany national chain restaurants and fast-food spots will remain open on Easter Sunday.Some restaurants, including Chick-fil-A and Chipotle, are expected to be closed for the holiday.It is recommended to call local restaurants to confirm their specific holiday hours.Happy Easter!Lent, a 40-day season of prayer and fasting observed by Christians before Easter, ended on Holy Thursday, April 2. Today's holiday celebrates the resurrection of Jesus Christ.Whether you want an untouched, pristine kitchen all day or your family just wants to switch things up and go out to eat for the holiday tonight, there are plenty of chain restaurants and fast food joints open on Easter Sunday.Need some help deciding? Here is what is open and closed throughout Florida.When is Easter 2026?Easter Sunday is today, April 5.In 2025, Easter fell much later in the month, on April 20. Eastern Orthodox Easter will fall on Sunday, April 12, 2026.Is Cracker Barrel open on Easter? Restaurants open for 2026 EasterA majority of national chain restaurants will still be open across the state. As for smaller chain restaurants or local hot spots, it is recommended to call ahead to confirm their hours for today.Applebee'sBob EvansBonefish GrillBoston MarketBuffalo Wild WingsBuca Di BeppoCarrabba's Italian GrillCheddar's Scratch KitchenChili'sCracker BarrelDenny'sGolden CorralFleming's Prime Steakhouse & Wine BarFogo de ChaoHootersIHOPLonghorn SteakhouseOlive GardenOutback SteakhousePerkins Restaurant & BakeryP.F. Chang’sRed LobsterRed RobinRomano's Macaroni GrillRuby TuesdaysRuth's Chris's SteakhouseSeasons 52STK SteakhouseTexas RoadhouseThe Cheesecake FactoryThe Capital GrilleWaffle HouseYard HouseIs Starbucks open on Easter? Fast food, quick-service restaurants open for 2026 EasterA majority of national chains will still be open across the state. As for smaller chains or local hot spots, it is recommended to call ahead to confirm their hours today.Burger FiBurger KingDairy QueenDomino's PizzaDunkin DonutsHardee'sJersey Mike'sJimmy John'sKFCLittle CaesarsMcDonald'sMoe'sPanda ExpressPanera BreadPapa JohnsPopeyesSonicStarbucksSteak N' ShakeSubwayTaco BellWawaWendy'sAre Chick-fil-A and Raising Cane's open on Easter? Here's what is closed on Easter 2026While not many chain restaurants and fast food spots close on Easter Sunday, there are still a few you won't be able to dine at today:Arby'sCAVAChick-fil-A (always closed on Sundays)Chicken Salad Chick (always closed on Sundays)ChipotleCulver'sFirehouse SubsMission BBQRaising Cane'sZaxby'sSamantha Neely is a trending reporter for the USA TODAY NETWORK-Florida, covering pop culture, theme parks, breaking news and more. You can get all of Florida’s best content directly in your inbox each weekday by signing up for the free newsletter, Florida TODAY, at https://floridatoday.com/newsletters.",
